## How this folder grows

At **sprint close** (per `docs/04-project/harness/engineering/sprint-workflow.md`),
the Planner hat batches Product Deltas marked `release-eligible` from
features closed in the sprint into a new entry under `versions/`. Version
bumps follow semver: breaking change → major, additive feature → minor,
fix only → patch.

A release entry is **append-only** after the version ships. Edits go
into the next version's notes.
